        <p class="iw-text">Nov 12 2026  7:20AM [18] [Notification] [CHP]-1039 3A - OP Y279  S/O# 58656999   PRO TOWING AND SERVICES (XXX) XXX-XXXX ETA 40  [Shared]<br />Nov 12 2026  7:12AM [15] 81-Z1 RDWY CLR - FSP ABLE TO GET VEH TO RS  [Shared]<br />Nov 12 2026  7:11AM [14] 21B CHP 97 // VEH IN TOW [Shared]<br />Nov 12 2026  7:05AM [13] RP CONFIRM TC OCCD WB / COPIES CHP HAS CALL [Shared]<br />Nov 12 2026  7:05AM [12] 21B 97 AT PHILLIPS RANCH TRYING TO MOVE 1 VEH TO RS // 2ND VEH ON RS [Shared]<br />Nov 12 2026  7:03AM [10] [Appended, 07:04:13] [4] RP ADV BOYFRIENDS CELL CALLED HER TO ADV OF A TC IN THIS AREA  [Shared]<br />Nov 12 2026  7:03AM [7] [Appended, 07:04:13] [1] BLIND TRANS  [Shared]<br />Nov 12 2026  7:03AM [5] PER DUPE BLK LEXUS VS SD BLKG  # 1 LANE  [Shared]<br />Nov 12 2026  6:55AM [1] [1] 2 VEH TC / RP IN BLK CADILLAC ESCALADE VS SD TYPE VEH BLKG  FAST LNS[Shared]<br /></p>
        
